{
//该翻译补丁经检查没有任何问题。
	"DialogueDictionary": {
		"Fret": "弗雷特",
		"Hi! I'm Fret.": "嗨！我是弗雷特。",
		"Nice to meet you.": "很高兴认识你。",
		"It's nice to meet you, too! Your village is quite cute, I must say.": "我也很高兴认识你！不得不说，你的村子真的很可爱。",
		"Thanks...?": "谢谢……？",
		"Are you a Nomai?": "你是挪麦人吗？",
		"Yes, I am! I'm just passing through.": "是的！我只是路过这里。",
		"Actually, I could use your help with something.": "其实，我有件事需要你帮忙。",
		"What is it?": "什么事？",
		"I found something strange on Ember Twin.": "我在灰烬双星上发现了奇怪的东西。",
		"Really? What is it?": "真的吗？发现了什么？",
		"...": "...",
		"Oh, that is strange.": "哦，这确实很奇怪。",
		"It seems like whatever those Nomai were up to led to their own self-destruction.": "看起来那些挪麦人所做的一切最终导致了他们自身的毁灭。",
		"I do not understand the full range of power of the magic banjo, but you must ensure that it does not do any more damage.": "我不清楚那把魔法班卓琴的全部力量，但你必须确保它不会造成更多伤害。",
		"Wait... did you say that there were <![CDATA[<color=orange>two</color>]]> bodies in the Quantum Cave?": "等等……你是说量子洞穴里有<![CDATA[<color=orange>两具</color>]]>尸体吗？",
		"I thought for certain there were <![CDATA[<color=orange>three</color>]]> Nomai...": "我确定应该有<![CDATA[<color=orange>三个</color>]]>挪麦人才对……",
		"Unfortunately, I'm not here on vacation.": "不巧，我不是来度假的。",
		"I'm looking for my magic banjo.": "我是来寻找我的魔法班卓琴的。",
		"Your magic... banjo?": "你的魔法……班卓琴？",
		"That's right! A group of Nomai stole it from me and fled to this solar system.": "没错！一群挪麦人从我这里偷走了它，逃到了这个太阳系。",
		"I only just started searching, but I've determined that it is not on <![CDATA[<color=orange>Timber Hearth</color>]]>.": "我才刚开始找，但已经确定它不在<![CDATA[<color=orange>木炉星</color>]]>上。",
		"I tried using the radio at the house behind me to locate it, but I can't get it to work. It doesn't seem to be making any <![CDATA[<color=orange>sound</color>]]>.": "我试着用我身后房子里的收音机来定位它，但没法用。它似乎完全没发出<![CDATA[<color=orange>声音</color>]]>。",
		"It's a bit more analog than I'm used to.": "它比我习惯用的那种要更偏向模拟信号。",
		"Anyway, I'm going to rest here for a moment before continuing. If you wouldn't mind, keep an eye out for my magic banjo.": "总之，我要在这里休息一会儿再继续找。如果不麻烦的话，帮我留意一下我的魔法班卓琴。",
		"I found a black hole that took me to a new solar system!": "我找到了一个带我去到一个全新恒星系的黑洞！",
		"A new solar system?": "一个全新的恒星系？",
		"So it's true, then. They used the banjo to create another solar system. That means everything in that system comes from <![CDATA[<color=orange>the mind of the one that played the banjo</color>]]>.": "所以这是真的。他们用了班卓琴来创造一个全新的恒星系。这意味着星系里所有的东西都源自弹奏班卓琴的人的思想。",
		"That's right! Nothing within that solar system is original! All of it is a mixture of the Nomai's thoughts and experiences. What a terrifying thought.": "没错！那个恒星系里没有一样东西是原创的！全都是挪麦人的思想和经历的混合体。这想法多可怕啊。",
		"Anyway, thank you for your help today. Even though I could not retrieve the banjo, it is far out of anyone or anything's reach.": "总之，谢谢你今天的帮助。虽然我没能取回班卓琴，但它已经远远超出了任何人或任何事物能够触及的范围。",
		"I'll return back to my clan soon.": "我将很快返回我的家族。",
		"By the way, I noticed another banjo on this planet with strange properties. I dismissed it earlier, but I took a closer look while you were gone.": "对了，我在这颗星球上发现了另一把有着奇特属性的班卓琴。我之前没在意，但你走后我仔细看了看。",
		"I detected it near <![CDATA[<color=orange>the mountain range to the west</color>]]>. Might be worth a look!": "我在<![CDATA[<color=orange>西边的山脉附近</color>]]>探测到了它。或许值得去看看！",

		"RIM: Just to be clear, I'm recording this only because Reson told me to.": "瑞姆：说清楚点，我录这个只是因为雷森让我录的。",
		"RIM: Also, these radios are horrible. I can't get mine to work!": "瑞姆：而且，这些收音机太烂了。我的根本用不了！",
		"RIM: That's fine, as I don't have much to report anyway. This moon has nothing to offer us.": "瑞姆：不过也没关系，反正我也没什么可报告的。这颗卫星对我们来说毫无用处。",
		"RIM: If Reson still wants to go through with this, I recommend we find somewhere <![CDATA[<color=orange>dark and enclosed</color>]]>.": "瑞姆：如果雷森还想继续这项任务，我建议我们找个<![CDATA[<color=orange>阴暗且封闭</color>]]>的地方。",
		"RIM: And this moon fits neither of those requirements.": "瑞姆：而这颗卫星这两个条件都不符合。",
		"RIM: I really hope the others have had more success than I.": "瑞姆：真希望其他人比我顺利些。",

		"BRIDGE: I hate this planet.": "布里奇：我讨厌这颗星球。",
		"BRIDGE: Believe it or not, but I don't enjoy being bombarded by meteors every 22 seconds!": "布里奇：信不信由你，我可不想每22秒就被陨石砸一次！",
		"BRIDGE: However, it has been worth it to study the fascinating <![CDATA[<color=orange>quantum mechanics</color>]]> this planet offers. This is definitely something we can use on this mission.": "布里奇：不过，研究这颗星球上迷人的<![CDATA[<color=orange>量子力学</color>]]>还是很值得的。这肯定对我们的任务有用。",
		"BRIDGE: At least this place is more interesting than that moon Rim went to.": "布里奇：至少这个地方比瑞姆去的那颗卫星有趣多了。",

		"RESON: While this planet is far from what we need to execute our plans, it has been a scientific thrill to explore.": "雷森：虽然这颗星球远不符合我们执行计划的需求，但探索它带来了科学上的兴奋感。",
		"RESON: I do not believe the jellyfish that call this place home are native to this planet. I would love to study them further.": "雷森：我认为栖息在这里的水母并非这颗星球的原生生物。我很想进一步研究它们。",
		"RESON: Unfortunately, we are running out of time. Fret has probably already noticed that something is wrong. We must complete our mission soon.": "雷森：不幸的是，我们时间不多了。弗雷特可能已经察觉到不对劲了。我们必须尽快完成任务。",
		"RESON: We cannot execute our plans on Giant's Deep, as it is <![CDATA[<color=orange>way too far from the sun</color>]]>, making it <![CDATA[<color=orange>far too cold</color>]]>.": "雷森：我们不能在深巨星执行计划，因为那里<![CDATA[<color=orange>离太阳太远</color>]]>，导致它<![CDATA[<color=orange>太冷了</color>]]>。",
		"RESON: I think I have a better planet in mind.": "雷森：我想我心里有个更合适的星球。",

		"RESON: The ritual is complete.": "雷森：仪式完成了。",




		"SIGN": "告示牌",
		"I finally finished my project! That took me a lot longer than I thought it would.": "我终于完成我的项目了！这比我预想的花了长得多的时间。",
		"I'm quite proud of myself. I set out to do this such a long time ago, and now it's finally complete.": "我为自己感到很自豪。很久以前我就打算做这个了，现在终于完成了。",
		"However, I'm a bit worried. I don't think many people will like it.": "不过，我有点担心。我觉得不会有很多人喜欢它。",
		"Maybe I should wait and reveal it once I'm ready. I'm not ready for judging eyes to mock my work.": "也许我应该等准备好了再展示它。我还没准备好面对那些评判的目光和对我作品的嘲笑。",
		"I'll make up my mind after my trip to Bracket's Rest.": "我去布拉克特休息点一趟后再做决定。",
		"Yesterday I flew to the strange wall on the south pole of Lost Strings.": "昨天我飞到了失落之弦南极的那面奇怪的墙壁处。",
		"I am not sure what it is doing there, but I discovered that it is connected to three scrolls scattered across the solar system.": "我不知道它为什么会在那里，但我发现它和散落在整个恒星系的三份卷轴有关联。",
		"One of them is on the <![CDATA[<color=orange>other side of Green Base</color>]]>. Another is <![CDATA[<color=orange>somewhere on Dried Tears</color>]]>.": "其中一份在<![CDATA[<color=orange>绿色基地的另一边</color>]]>。另一份在<![CDATA[<color=orange>干涸之泪的某个地方</color>]]>。",
		"The last one seems to be <![CDATA[<color=orange>connected to the giant banjo itself</color>]]>.": "最后一份似乎<![CDATA[<color=orange>与那把巨大的班卓琴本身有关联</color>]]>。",
		"I'm thrilled at the aspect of this discovery! I will schedule a day to explore further.": "这个发现让我非常兴奋！我会安排一天时间进一步探索。",

		"the skeleton": "骨架",
		"Follow my eyes, I am not blind.": "跟着我的目光，我不是瞎子。",
		"Follow my eyes, to see what you'll find.": "跟着我的目光，看看你会发现什么。",

		"Ernesto": "厄内斯托",
		"My mere existence causes timeline complications.": "我仅仅是存在就会导致时间线混乱。",
		"Anyway, you can find some of my friends on Dried Tears. They're waiting for you.": "对了，你可以在干涸之泪找到我的一些朋友。他们在等你。",

		"Rim": "瑞姆",
		"Hello, friend.": "你好，朋友。",
		"Rim? I thought you were dead!": "瑞姆？我以为你死了呢！",
		"Dead? I don't know what you're talking about. I've lived in this galaxy my <![CDATA[<color=orange>entire life</color>]]>!": "死了？我不知道你在说什么。我<![CDATA[<color=orange>一辈子都</color>]]>生活在这个星系里！",
		"However... for some reason... I can't seem to remember my childhood...": "不过……不知怎么回事……我好像记不起我的童年了……",
		"Perhaps I am just tired.": "也许我只是累了。",
		"What's up with this ice?": "这冰怎么回事？",
		"It's quite peculiar, isn't it?": "很奇特，对吧？",
		"I ran a few tests on it. It has a similar consistency to the ice found at the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Lost Village</color>]]>.": "我对它做了些测试。它的质地和在<![CDATA[<color=orange>失落村庄</color>]]>发现的冰很相似。",
		"I've seen this ice all over the galaxy! I wonder where it all came from?": "我在整个星系都见过这种冰！真想知道它们都来自哪里？",
		"However, I think I have a more important question...": "不过，我想我有个更重要的问题……",
		"Who will be the first person to stand on top of this thing?": "谁会是第一个站在这东西顶端的人呢？",
		"I'm going to keep looking around.": "我要继续四处看看。",
		"Go forth.": "去吧。",

		"Reson": "雷森",
		"Hello. I didn't expect to see anyone else here.": "你好。没想到在这里还能见到其他人。",
		"I'm sure you have questions.": "我知道你有很多问题。",
		"What is this place?": "这是什么地方？",
		"You are standing in the newly-created <![CDATA[<color=orange>Banjo Galaxy</color>]]>.": "你现在站在新创建的<![CDATA[<color=orange>班卓琴星系</color>]]>里。",
		"At least, I think you are. My tracking technology doesn't seem to be working here.": "至少，我认为是这样。我的追踪技术在这里好像失灵了。",
		"This place was created by my cohorts and I using the magic banjo. However, I did not anticipate that plucking the strings would cost my friends their lives.": "这个地方是我和我的同伴们用魔法班卓琴创造出来的。但我没预料到拨动琴弦会让我的朋友们付出生命的代价。",
		"In this universe, playing god will always cost you.": "在这个宇宙里，扮演上帝总会让你付出代价。",
		"Who are you?": "你是谁？",
		"My name is <![CDATA[<color=orange>Reson</color>]]>. I am a member of an advanced species known as the Nomai. I am an explorer, just like you.": "我的名字是<![CDATA[<color=orange>雷森</color>]]>。我是一个名为挪麦的先进种族的一员。我和你一样，是个探索者。",
		"My guild and I were exploring a solar system not too far from your own when we discovered the banjo.": "我和我的团队在探索一个离你们星系不远的太阳系时发现了这把班卓琴。",
		"The planet had been stripped of its resources. The grass wasn't growing and the rivers had all dried up. There wasn't a tree in sight.": "那颗星球的资源被掠夺一空。草不长，河流也都干涸了。放眼望去，一棵树都没有。",
		"But, somehow, there sat the banjo. Peacefully lying against a tree.": "但不知怎的，那里放着一把班卓琴。静静地靠在一棵树上。",
		"Like someone had just used it.": "就像有人刚刚用过一样。",
		"After studying it at our camp, Fret determined that it had the power to solve the problem that no Nomai could: avoiding the <![CDATA[<color=orange>End of the Universe</color>]]>.": "我们在营地研究它之后，弗雷特认定它拥有解决挪麦人都无法解决的问题的力量：避免<![CDATA[<color=orange>宇宙的终结</color>]]>。",
		"Fret thought it was too dangerous to use. Rim, Bridge, and I disagreed. If there was a chance to save our species, why not take it?": "弗雷特认为使用它太危险了。但我、瑞姆和布里奇不同意。如果有机会拯救我们的种族，为什么不试试呢？",
		"What does the banjo do?": "那把班卓琴有什么用？",
		"The magic banjo is very powerful, and I regret not taking the time to study it further.": "这把魔法班卓琴非常强大，我很后悔没有花更多时间去深入研究它。",
		"When we studied it at our camp, we determined that it has <![CDATA[<color=orange>space-altering properties</color>]]>.": "我们在营地研究时发现，它具有<![CDATA[<color=orange>改变空间的特性</color>]]>。",
		"A few chords played on the banjo are enough to create entire galaxies. We are standing in the result of a simple G chord.": "在班卓琴上弹奏几个和弦就足以创造出整个星系。我们现在所处的地方就是一个简单的G和弦的产物。",
		"I wanted to play it more once I arrived on this world, but the banjo disappeared as I stepped through the singularity.": "我到达这个世界后还想多弹一会儿，但当我穿过奇点时，班卓琴就消失了。",
		"I'm not too concerned, though. I have a feeling it is <![CDATA[<color=orange>close by</color>]]>.": "不过，我不太担心。我感觉它<![CDATA[<color=orange>就在附近</color>]]>。",
		"What lies beyond this planet?": "这颗星球之外有什么？",
		"I am not sure. The skies above us are cloudy, and I did not bring the proper equipment to travel off-world.": "我不确定。我们头顶的天空乌云密布，而且我没有带合适的设备离开这颗星球。",
		"Interestingly, it looks like a <![CDATA[<color=orange>Hearthian vessel</color>]]> appeared here moments before you did.": "有趣的是，在你到来前不久，似乎有一艘<![CDATA[<color=orange>哈斯飞船</color>]]>出现在这里。",
		"It seems that fate has chosen you to be the first to see what's beyond the fog.": "看来命运选择了你成为第一个看到浓雾之外景象的人。",
		"I'm going to look around.": "我要四处看看。",
		"Fair well on your exploration.": "祝你探索顺利。",

		"Strum": "斯特鲁姆",
		"Hello. Are you here to chat?": "你好。你来是想聊天吗？",
		"It's good to see you again.": "很高兴再次见到你。",
		"It's good to see you, too! Thanks for chatting with me earlier. You really helped me sort out my thoughts.": "我也很高兴见到你！谢谢你之前和我聊天。你真的帮我理清了思路。",
		"I would love for you to stop by my house sometime! It's located at the <![CDATA[<color=orange>south pole of Green Base</color>]]>.": "我很希望你有空能来我家坐坐！我家在<![CDATA[<color=orange>绿色基地的南极</color>]]>。",
		"Or what's left of it, anyway.": "不管怎么说，是它剩下的部分。",
		"Why are you out here?": "你为什么在这里？",
		"I came out here to brighten up this planetoid with a little plant life.": "我来这里是想种些植物，让这颗小行星变得更有生机。",
		"As you can see, I gave up an hour or so ago.": "如你所见，我大约一小时前就放弃了。",
		"Oh, I'm Strum by the way. Scientist and entrepreneur.": "哦对了，我叫斯特鲁姆。我是个科学家，也是个富有进取心的人。",
		"Hey... do you mind if I ask you some questions? I've had a lot on my mind lately.": "嘿……我能问你几个问题吗？我最近有很多心事。",
		"What do you think is the purpose of creating?": "你认为创造的目的是什么？",
		"To express yourself.": "为了表达自己。",
		"To show off to others.": "为了向别人炫耀。",
		"To make the world a better place.": "为了让世界变得更美好。",
		"I tend to agree with that. It's very important. Ok, I have another...": "我倾向于同意这个观点。这非常重要。好的，我还有一个……",
		"If that goal is not achieved, has the creator failed?": "如果那个目标没有实现，创造者就失败了吗？",
		"Yes. They have not accomplished what they set out to do.": "是的。他们没有完成自己着手去做的事情。",
		"No. Creating itself is its own reward.": "不。创造本身就是一种回报。",
		"I don't know.": "我不知道。",
		"Interesting. One last question...": "很有趣。最后一个问题……",
		"What is the relationship between a creation and its creator?": "你认为创造物和创造者之间是什么关系？",
		"A creation is subject to the wills of its creator.": "创造物服从于创造者的意志。",
		"A creation has the right to do whatever it wants, regardless of what its creator thinks.": "不管创造者怎么想，创造物都有权做自己想做的事。",
		"It depends on the situation.": "这要看情况。",
		"Fascinating. Do you truly believe those things?": "很有意思。你真的相信那些吗？",
		"Yes.": "是的。",
		"Good. Hold fast to your beliefs. Sometimes they are all we have.": "很好。坚守你的信念。有时候，信念是我们唯一拥有的东西。",
		"No.": "不是。",
		"You and I are more similar than I thought. I've been out here so long I can't remember what I believe anymore.": "你和我比我想象的更像。我在这里待了太久，都不记得自己相信什么了。",
		"I struggle because sometimes it feels like <![CDATA[<color=orange>the work I employ will never suffice</color>]]>.": "我很纠结，因为有时候感觉<![CDATA[<color=orange>我所做的工作永远都不够</color>]]>。",
		"Thanks for chatting with me. You've given me a lot to think about. I'll rest for another moment, but then I will get back to work.": "谢谢你和我聊天。你让我想了很多。我再休息一会儿，然后就回去工作。",
		"No, I'm just passing through.": "不，我只是路过。",
		"Thanks for stopping by.": "谢谢你路过。",

		"Tuner": "图纳",
		"Hello! Welcome to the Banjo Galaxy.": "你好！欢迎来到班卓琴星系。",
		"Green Base is lovely today, isn't it?": "绿色基地今天很宜人，不是吗？",
		"Riebeck? What are you doing here?": "瑞拜克？你在这里做什么？",
		"Riebeck? You must be confusing me with someone else. I'm <![CDATA[<color=orange>Tuner</color>]]>.": "瑞拜克？你一定是把我和别人弄混了。我是<![CDATA[<color=orange>图纳</color>]]>。",
		"I'm an explorer from somewhere very far away. I came looking for inspiration to write a new song.": "我是一个来自很远地方的探险家。我是来寻找创作新歌的灵感的。",
		"I'm not really a musician, but I want to be.": "我算不上是个音乐家，但我想成为音乐家。",
		"That's the tricky part about improving yourself... You have to always be seeking out new hobbies and skills.": "这就是提升自己的棘手之处……你必须不断寻找新的爱好和技能。",
		"That's why I haven't stopped playing since we started talking. Hope it doesn't bother you.": "所以自从我们开始聊天，我就一直没停下弹奏。希望没打扰到你。",
		"Where are we?": "我们在哪里？",
		"You're currently standing in the <![CDATA[<color=orange>Lost Village</color>]]> on Green Base.": "你现在站在绿色基地的<![CDATA[<color=orange>失落村庄</color>]]>里。",
		"Or that's my name for it, anyway. I thought it was fitting.": "不管怎么说，这是我给它起的名字。我觉得很合适。",
		"Apparently this planet went through an ice age or two, and the previous tenants got sick of it and left. Well, most of them did anyway.": "显然这颗星球经历过一两次冰河期，以前的居民受不了就离开了。嗯，反正大部分人都走了。",
		"I don't know much else than that. There's a lot of recordings scattered around that I can't translate. Perhaps you have <![CDATA[<color=orange>something that can translate them</color>]]>.": "除此之外我就不太清楚了。周围散落着很多录音，我翻译不了。也许你有<![CDATA[<color=orange>能翻译它们的东西</color>]]>。",
		"It saddens me, though, to see the village abandoned like this. Imagine spending years building it, only to leave it all behind.": "不过，看到这个村庄被这样遗弃，我很伤心。想想看，花了好几年来建造，最后却把它全抛下了。",
		"Every creator's fear.": "这是每个创造者的恐惧。",
		"Need help with your song?": "需要帮忙创作你的歌吗？",
		"Yes! I'd love to have you help me with my song!": "是的！我很希望你能帮我创作这首歌！",
		"I have the melody written already, so all I need are some fire <![CDATA[<color=orange>lyrics</color>]]>.": "我已经写好旋律了，所以只需要一些超棒的<![CDATA[<color=orange>歌词</color>]]>。",
		"In order to match the music, I need you to find <![CDATA[<color=orange>two verses with two lines apiece</color>]]>. Or just four lines.": "为了配合音乐，我需要你找到<![CDATA[<color=orange>两节诗，每节两行</color>]]>。或者说就是四行。",
		"There are many interesting places to draw inspiration from across this galaxy. Try casting your net wide!": "在这个星系里，有很多有趣的地方可以汲取灵感。试着广泛寻找吧！",
		"Bring me the lyrics when you find them!": "找到歌词后把它们带给我！",
		"I have some fire lyrics for you!": "我为你找到一些超棒的歌词了！",
		"Did you find all of them?": "你都找到了吗？",
		"You did! Great! Let's try them out...": "你找到了！太棒了！我们来试试……",
		"<![CDATA[<color=orange>At cost of time and life of friend, Our broken people I seek to amend.</color>]]>": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>以时间和朋友的生命为代价，我试图弥补我们破碎的族群。</color>]]>",
		"<![CDATA[<color=orange>Our world is buried under ice. The work I employ will never suffice.</color>]]>": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>我们的世界被埋在冰下。我所做的工作永远都不够。</color>]]>",
		"Well, that's interesting. That's not quite what I was looking for, but I'll take it.": "嗯，很有意思。这和我想要的不太一样，但我会采用的。",
		"More importantly, I understand how you feel.": "更重要的是，我理解你的感受。",
		"Being an artist is scary. You are always at the risk of critisism and mockery.": "当艺术家是很可怕的。你总是面临着被批评和嘲笑的风险。",
		"You pour your heart into your work and sometimes it doesn't amount to much, or you are beaten out by the better man in the end.": "你全身心投入到作品中，可有时却收效甚微，或者最终被更优秀的人比下去。",
		"However, that should never discourage you from discovering <![CDATA[<color=orange>who you are</color>]]>.": "然而，这绝不应阻止你去发现<![CDATA[<color=orange>你是谁</color>]]>。",
		"And by helping me write this song, you have shown your desire for artistic expression. So thank you for that, friend.": "通过帮我写这首歌，你展现了你对艺术表达的渴望。所以谢谢你，朋友。",
		"This isn't the last time you and I will cross paths. I'm sure we will see each other agian.": "这不是我们最后一次相遇。我相信我们还会再见面的。",
		"Don't <![CDATA[<color=orange>fret</color>]]> over it. ;)": "<![CDATA[<color=orange>别担心</color>]]>。;)",
		"I'll talk to you later!": "回头再聊！",
		"Have fun exploring the galaxy! Return here if you get worn out or want to chat.": "尽情探索这个星系吧！如果你累了或者想聊天，就回到这里来。",



		"???: Our world is buried under ice.": "???: 我们的世界被埋在冰下。",

		"ANT: I'm going to move my piece... here. Then I'll block you by placing a shield here!": "安特：我要移动我的棋子……到这里。然后我会在这里放一个盾牌挡住你！",
		"BRANCH: Hey! That's cheating!": "布兰奇：嘿！那是作弊！",
		"ANT: No, it's not! It's my turn! I can place the shield anywhere I want!": "安特：不，不是的！轮到我了！我可以把盾牌放在任何我想放的地方！",
		"BRANCH: No! You said you would go easy on me!": "布兰奇：不！你说过会对我手下留情的！",
		"ANT: No, I said I would-": "安特：不，我说我会-",
		"ANT: ...": "安特：...",
		"ANT: Did that door just open by itself?": "安特：那扇门刚刚是自己开了吗？",

		"RESON: Here we are: under hundreds of feet of rock with the most powerful artifact ever discovered.": "雷森：我们到了：在数百英尺的岩石之下，有着迄今为止发现的最强大的神器。",
		"BRIDGE: Reson, how high is our success rate? I'm feeling uncertain about this. The phrase \"at cost of time and life of friend\" doesn't sound very reassuring.": "布里奇：雷森，我们的成功率有多高？我对此感到不确定。“以时间和朋友的生命为代价”这句话听起来可不怎么让人安心。",
		"RIM: Relax, Bridge! You studied those ancient texts more than anyone else. This will work.": "瑞姆：放松点，布里奇！你比任何人都深入研究过那些古籍。这会成功的。",
		"RESON: Here we go! I'm going to play a chord.": "雷森：开始了！我要弹奏一个和弦。",
		"RESON: ...Are you guys OK?": "雷森：……你们还好吗？",

		"TWIG: Sir, we cannot stay here any longer. It is getting too cold!": "特威格：先生，我们不能再待在这里了。天太冷了！",
		"OAKEN: We can't leave yet! Not until we find them!": "奥肯：我们还不能走！在找到他们之前不能走！",
		"TWIG: Sir... it may be time to give up the search. We've been looking for them for weeks. I don't think they're going to show up.": "特威格：先生……也许是时候放弃搜寻了。我们已经找了他们好几个星期了。我觉得他们不会出现了。",
		"OAKEN: You don't know that.": "奥肯：你不知道会怎样。",
		"TWIG: ...": "特威格：...",
		"TWIG: Sir... I'm taking my family and evacuating.": "特威格：先生……我要带我的家人撤离了。",
		"OAKEN: ...": "奥肯：...",
		"OAKEN: Fine. Get your wife and children to safety. And I'll try to find mine.": "奥肯：好吧。把你的妻子和孩子送到安全的地方。我会试着找到我的家人。",
		"OAKEN: Our broken people I seek to amend.": "奥肯：我试图弥补我们破碎的族群。",

		"MAPLE: All I'm saying is, he's been acting strange ever since we arrived here.": "梅普尔：我想说的是，自从我们来到这里，他的行为就一直很奇怪。",
		"OAKEN: I know, dear, but that's hardly enough to convict someone of kidnapping.": "奥肯：我知道，亲爱的，但这几乎不足以判定有人绑架。",
		"MAPLE: Who else could it be? There aren't many of us left after The Pilgrimage! Surely you don't think it was Old Miss Cherry?": "梅普尔：还能有谁呢？朝圣之后我们就没剩多少人了！你不会认为是切瑞老小姐吧？",
		"OAKEN: Of course not! I haven't seen her get out of her rocker in a week.": "奥肯：当然不是！我一个星期都没见她从摇椅上下来过。",
		"MAPLE: I'm only joking, honey. We'll get to the bottom of this.": "梅普尔：我只是开玩笑的，亲爱的。我们会查清楚的。",
		"OAKEN: I know. It's not like there's anywhere for her to go.": "奥肯：我知道。她也没什么地方可去。",
		"OAKEN: It's too cold for her to be walking around unattended.": "奥肯：天这么冷，她不可能没人照看就到处走。"

	},
	"ShipLogDictionary": {
		"Fret's Quest": "弗雷特的任务",
		"There is a visitor somewhere in the Village near the geysers.": "村子里间歇泉附近某个地方有个访客。",
		"There is a visitor somewhere in the Village.": "村子里某个地方有个访客。",
		"A Visitor": "一位访客",
		"I met a Nomai named Fret in the Village. He said he is looking for his magic banjo that was stolen from him.": "我在村子里遇到了一个叫弗雷特的挪麦人。他说他在寻找被偷走的魔法班卓琴。",
		"Fret said that the banjo is not on Timber Hearth.": "弗雷特说班卓琴不在木炉星上。",
		"The radio outside Gneiss's house is emitting a weird signal.": "格尼斯家外面的收音机正在发出奇怪的信号。",
		"I reported my adventures to Fret. He appreciates me locating the magic banjo.": "我把我的冒险经历告诉了弗雷特。他很感谢我找到了魔法班卓琴。",

		"Tuner's Grave": "图纳之墓",
		"Fret mentioned that he found another banjo on Timber Hearth west of the Village in a mountain range.": "弗雷特提到他在木炉星村庄以西的山脉里发现了另一把班卓琴。",
		"I found the grave of a Hearthian named Tuner. Judging by the date on the tombstone, it appears they died years before I was born.": "我找到了一个叫图纳的哈斯人的坟墓。从墓碑上的日期来看，他似乎在我出生前几年就去世了。",

		"Strange Signal 1": "奇怪的信号 1",
		"Rim's Camp": "瑞姆的营地",
		"I followed one of the strange signals to a radio on the Attlerock.": "我跟着一个奇怪的信号找到了废岩星上的一台收音机。",
		"Bridge's Camp": "布里奇的营地",
		"Strange Signal 2": "奇怪的信号 2",
		"I followed one of the strange signals to a radio on Brittle Hollow.": "我跟着一个奇怪的信号找到了碎空星上的一台收音机。",
		"Reson's Camp": "雷森的营地",
		"Strange Signal 3": "奇怪的信号 3",
		"I followed one of the strange signals to a radio on Giant's Deep.": "我跟着一个奇怪的信号找到了深巨星上的一台收音机。",
		"Reson said that Giant's Deep is too far from the sun, making it way too cold for their plans. They will have to go to somewhere warmer and closer to the sun.": "雷森说深巨星离太阳太远，对他们的计划来说太冷了。他们得去一个更温暖、离太阳更近的地方。",

		"The Ritual": "仪式",
		"A Meeting": "一次会面",
		"I found the bodies of Rim and Bridge inside the Quantum Caves on Ember Twin. A black hole has formed within the cave.": "我在余烬双星的量子洞穴里发现了瑞姆和布里奇的尸体。洞穴里形成了一个黑洞。",
		"Reson mentioned that they needed to meet on a warm planet.": "雷森提到他们需要在一个温暖的星球上会面。",
		"Bridge said that they need to be near quantum mechanics.": "布里奇说他们需要在靠近量子力学的地方。",
		"Rim said that they need to be somewhere dark and secluded.": "瑞姆说他们需要在一个阴暗且隐蔽的地方。",


		"Reson": "雷森",
		"Mysterious Planet": "神秘星球",
		"I wonder if someone here can answer my questions.": "不知道这里有没有人能回答我的问题。",
		"I met Reson on the north pole of Lost Strings. He said that we are standing in a brand-new galaxy formed by the magic banjo.": "我在失落之弦的北极遇到了雷森。他说我们正站在一个由魔法班卓琴形成的全新星系里。",
		"Reson said that the magic banjo was found by his guild and realized it had incredible power. Fret didn't want to use it so Reson, Rim, and Bridge stole it.": "雷森说他的团队发现了这把魔法班卓琴，并意识到它拥有不可思议的力量。弗雷特不想使用它，所以雷森、瑞姆和布里奇偷走了它。",
		"Reson brought the magic banjo with him, but it doesn't appear to be on Lost Strings.": "雷森带着魔法班卓琴，但它似乎不在失落之弦上。",

		"Nomai Wall": "挪麦墙壁",
		"What else?": "还有什么？",
		"I think there is more I can learn on this planet.": "我觉得在这颗星球上我还有更多东西可以学习。",
		"I found a recording on Lost Strings that records the moment Reson's ritual took place.": "我在失落之弦上发现了一段录音，记录了雷森仪式进行的那一刻。",
		"\"At cost of time, and life of friend.\"": "“以时间和朋友的生命为代价。”",

		"Ice Spire": "冰尖塔",
		"I met Rim at the Ice Spire, and she was very much alive. She is struggling to remember her childhood for some reason.": "我在冰尖塔遇到了瑞姆，她还活着。不知为何，她很难记起自己的童年。",
		"Rim has been studying the ice. It is of the same consistency as the ice found at the Lost Village.": "瑞姆一直在研究这种冰。它和在失落村庄发现的冰质地相同。",

		"Lost Village": "失落村庄",
		"Ice Age?": "冰河期？",
		"Rim mentioned that the ice at the Ice Spire matches the ice at the Lost Village.": "瑞姆提到冰尖塔的冰和失落村庄的冰一样。",
		"Two children played a board game centered around the search for the Eye of the Universe.": "两个孩子在玩一个以寻找宇宙之眼为主题的棋盘游戏。",
		"One of the residents of the village is suspected of kidnapping. Also, it seems to be getting colder.": "村里的一位居民被怀疑参与了绑架。而且，天气似乎越来越冷了。",
		"Two villagers talked about plans to evacuate. One decided to stay behind.": "两个村民谈论了撤离计划。一个决定留下来。",
		"\"Our broken people I seek to amend.\"": "“我试图弥补我们破碎的族群。”",

		"Tuner's Song": "图纳的歌",
		"Strange Text": "奇怪的文字",
		"I met someone at the Lost Village that looks like Riebeck named Tuner.": "我在失落村庄遇到了一个长得像瑞拜克、名叫图纳的人。",
		"Tuner would like some help looking for the lyrics to his song. He needs two verses with two lines apiece. I should be able to find inspiration from the galaxy itself.": "图纳希望有人帮他寻找他歌曲的歌词。他需要两节诗，每节两行。我应该能从这个星系本身找到灵感。",
		"I helped Tuner find lyrics for his song. The quest ends here.": "我帮图纳找到了他歌曲的歌词。任务到此结束。", //<![CDATA[<color=orange>感谢您游玩弗雷特的任务！</color>]]> 这句话不知为何出现在这里。无论如何先放这。
		"I found a strange recorder on Dried Tears.": "我在干涸之泪上发现了一个奇怪的录音机。",
		"I found some strange words in the Lost Village.": "我在失落村庄发现了一些奇怪的文字。",
		"I learned some wisdom from a Hearthian named Strum on Bracket's Rest.": "我在布拉克特休息点从一个叫斯特鲁姆的哈斯人那里领略了一些智慧。",
		"I learned a strange phrase from a Nomai scroll on Lost Strings.": "我从失落之弦上的一份挪麦卷轴学到了一个奇怪的短语。",

		"Strum's House": "斯特鲁姆的房子",
		"Invitation": "邀请",
		"Strum just finished a big project that he was very proud of. However, he isn't telling anyone what it is because he is scared of being mocked.": "斯特鲁姆刚刚完成了一个他引以为傲的大项目。但他因为害怕被嘲笑而没有告诉任何人那是什么。",
		"Strum invited me to visit what's left of his house near the south pole of Green Base.": "斯特鲁姆邀请我去参观他在绿色基地南极附近剩下的房子。",

		"Ernesto": "厄内斯托",
		"I found a friendly anglerfish skeleton named Ernesto. He told me that some of his friends can be found on Dried Tears.": "我发现了一个友好的安康鱼骨架，名叫厄内斯托。他告诉我在干涸之泪能找到他的一些朋友。",
		"An anglerfish skeleton on Green Base told me he has friends on Dried Tears.": "绿色基地上的一个安康鱼骨架告诉我他在干涸之泪有朋友。",

		"Anglerfish Skeletons": "安康鱼骨架",
		"Ernesto's Friends": "厄内斯托的朋友",
		"An anglerfish on Dried Tears spoke to me in my head.": "干涸之泪上的一条安康鱼在我脑海里跟我说话。",
		"\"Our world is buried under ice.\"": "“我们的世界被埋在冰下。”",

		"Strum": "斯特鲁姆",
		"I met a Hearthian on Bracket's Rest that wanted to bring life to the small planetoid.": "我在布拉克特休息点遇到了一个想给这颗小行星带来生机的哈斯人。",
		"Strum got discouraged and stopped spreading the plant life once he realized that he was the only person that would care.": "当斯特鲁姆意识到只有他自己会在意时，他感到气馁并停止了种植植物。",
		"\"The work I employ will never suffice.\"": "“我所做的工作永远都不够。”"
	},
	"UIDictionary": {
		"White Sun": "白色太阳",

		"The Magic Banjo": "魔法班卓琴",
		"Lost Strings": "失落之弦",
		"Green Base": "绿色基地",
		"Dried Tears": "干涸之泪",
		"Bracket's Rest": "布拉克特休息点",


		"Hearthian Radio": "哈斯收音机",

		"Gneiss's Radio": "格尼斯的收音机",
		"Bridge's Radio": "布里奇的收音机",
		"Rim's Radio": "瑞姆的收音机",
		"Reson's Radio": "雷森的收音机",

		"Strum's Radio": "斯特鲁姆的收音机",
		"Rim's Second Radio": "瑞姆的第二台收音机",
		"Reson's Second Radio": "雷森的第二台收音机",
